","x":1410,"y":1317,"width":67,"height":37}]},{"text":"ACK가 발생할 때까지 혼잡 원도-우는 선형으로 증가한다. 손실 이벤트가 발생했을 때,","words":[{"text":"ACK가","x":183,"y":1376,"width":111,"height":37},{"text":"발생할","x":307,"y":1376,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"때까지","x":422,"y":1376,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"혼잡","x":534,"y":1376,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"원도-우는","x":615,"y":1375,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"선형으로","x":762,"y":1376,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"증가한다.","x":905,"y":1377,"width":140,"height":37},{"text":"손실","x":1060,"y":1377,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"이벤트가","x":1142,"y":1377,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"발생했을","x":1288,"y":1378,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"때,","x":1437,"y":1378,"width":39,"height":37}]},{"text":"그 당시의 혼잡 윈도우가 12 MSS임을 주목하기 바란다. 그러면 임계치는 0.5 • cwnd","words":[{"text":"그","x":183,"y":1442,"width":32,"height":25},{"text":"당시의","x":227,"y":1436,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"혼잡","x":338,"y":1437,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"윈도우가","x":420,"y":1437,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"12","x":569,"y":1441,"width":32,"height":28},{"text":"MSS임을","x":631,"y":1437,"width":144,"height":37},{"text":"주목하기","x":786,"y":1437,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"바란다.","x":931,"y":1438,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"그러면","x":1050,"y":1437,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"임계치는","x":1165,"y":1438,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"0.5","x":1309,"y":1443,"width":46,"height":28},{"text":"•","x":1370,"y":1458,"width":6,"height":5},{"text":"cwnd","x":1387,"y":1445,"width":90,"height":27}]},{"text":"= 6 MSS가 된다. TCP Reno에서는 혼잡 원도우가 6 • MSS로 되고 선형적으로 증","words":[{"text":"=","x":187,"y":1512,"width":22,"height":11},{"text":"6","x":227,"y":1501,"width":18,"height":29},{"text":"MSS가","x":278,"y":1498,"width":112,"height":37},{"text":"된다.","x":405,"y":1498,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":494,"y":1502,"width":71,"height":29},{"text":"Reno에서는","x":580,"y":1497,"width":182,"height":38},{"text":"혼잡","x":776,"y":1497,"width":67,"height":37},{"text